<title>USA: CNA Financial Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>CNA Financial Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.83		    $2.66</p>
<p> Net			238,500		  166,300</p>
<p> Revs		   4,255,600		4,000,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,800		   61,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
